A while back, I created a Nethack Note Sheet to help me identify items.  It
was broken down by item type, and then had tables with all of the
descriptors, with space for the cost and the type, with the price
break-downs of the items at the bottom.  This worked fairly well (got me
through my first-and only, so far-ascension), and was a lot better than
constantly scrolling through an ever-changing vi document, but I'm not
convinced that it was perfect.  For one, it was already two pages long (both
sides of a regular piece of paper), and didn't have much of any room for
extraneous notes (such as the presence of altars/shops/vaults on random
floors, etc.)

So, what do you use to track your NH games?  Back of an envelope?  Some sort
of template?  What are its strengths and weaknesses?  Are there any decent
note sheets available online?



